    {
      "id": "claim_8831d4650e9c476bb665d2e478dbf9b8",
      "statement": "The MCP server Dockerfile is a two-stage build whose build context is the repository root (not mcp-server/), invoked as `docker build -f mcp-server/Dockerfile .`, so the runtime stage can copy the Antora docs corpus from docs/modules/ROOT/.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/Dockerfile#L1-L9",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6ce5c40c310638df33f03120bd7c6d0a78666e30c36b3f165fe298049b7cb271:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/README.md#L33-L45",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:aa2930dbf5247fdec24f78bfc37601b2969ebbe58686bdba5244235298139db8:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_d8994f2ab811482da63fe9791d909d52",
      "statement": "The builder stage runs `npm ci` then `npm run build` (tsc) to emit dist/, and the runtime stage runs `npm ci --omit=dev` for production deps and copies only dist/ plus the baked read-only docs pages/examples/partials into /app/docs.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/Dockerfile#L2-L24",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ca832bbffcd789ac7b5d25e608b68688aa70ec54bc6fc41014a3c9c25e982818:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_98fae7b515fa4cf0a22f316de61c92a7",
      "statement": "The Dockerfile bakes image-internal config via ENV: DOCS_ROOT=/app/docs/pages, PARTIALS_ROOT=/app/docs/partials, EXAMPLES_ROOT=/app/docs/examples, DATA_DIR=/data, PORT=8765; these match the zod defaults in src/config.ts (DATA_DIR defaults to /data, PORT to 8765).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/Dockerfile#L26-L30",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3428e6cbcbfdd161b3621075c0859f2a84d478d5c3064e3b11c3dabaf5218681:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://mcp-server/src/config.ts#L4-L8",
